  "description": "Typed .NET client for the Polish REGON register (GUS BIR1.2 web service): search by NIP, REGON or KRS, batches of up to 20, full reports of legal persons, sole traders and local units, session handling and a request limiter. Needs your own free GUS key (the public test environment works without one). Unofficial; not affiliated with GUS or the Polish government.",
